# Masonry fill for the body of a platform. Tiles on both axes.
#
# The courses are offset between the top and bottom halves so a wall two tiles
# tall does not stack its joints into a visible column — the tell that gives a
# tiled texture away faster than anything else.
name platformer-ground
size 16 16
key o outline
key S stone-0-shadow
key m stone-1
pixels
oSSSSSSSoSSSSSSo
*6 SmmmmmmSSmmmmmmS
oSSSSSSoSSSSSSSo
SSmmmmmmmmSSmmmS
*6 mmmmmmmmmmSSmmmm
SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS
